{"id": "lobbyist-late-fee-collection-deadline", "title": "A collection deadline expired with $6,850 in lobbyist late fees on the books", "seconds": 43.0, "voice": "elevenlabs:OtHu0lbpdNTqJVqaxDtR", "narrator": "Maven", "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "b24cf4182eef5379", "words": 139, "beats": [{"scene": "p", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The Ethics Commission referred $7,000 in lobbyist late fees for Isabel Urbano to the Bureau of Delinquent Revenue.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 5.82, "shot": "r0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["A", "collection", "deadline"], "sub": "Lobbyist late fees"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.51, 0.92, 1.26, 1.54, 1.86, 2.19, 2.3, 2.7, 2.89, 3.17, 3.34, 3.67, 4.11, 4.23, 4.33, 4.65, 4.74, 5.16]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The Bureau listed a payment plan of $75 a month.", "t0": 5.94, "t1": 8.62, "shot": "r1", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "may", "kicker": "May 2017", "text": "$75", "mark": "$75"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.41, 0.7, 0.76, 1.06, 1.34, 1.45, 2.0, 2.29, 2.37]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The collection reports track the fee balance separately from the payment plan.", "t0": 8.74, "t1": 11.83, "shot": "r1-detail", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "The collection reports track the fee balance separately from the payment plan"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.48, 0.86, 1.1, 1.22, 1.42, 1.75, 2.2, 2.36, 2.45, 2.75]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "In June 2017 the Bureau recorded $225 paid.", "t0": 12.05, "t1": 15.89, "shot": "r2", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$6,775", "label": "June balance"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.4, 0.68, 1.31, 1.47, 1.77, 2.21, 2.46, 2.7, 3.18, 3.5]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "That left $6,775.", "t0": 16.01, "t1": 18.65, "shot": "r3", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "That left $6,775"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.38, 0.6, 1.03, 1.3, 1.61, 2.15]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The November report still said the Bureau received $225.", "t0": 18.77, "t1": 22.59, "shot": "r4", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "nov", "kicker": "November 2017", "text": "$6,850", "mark": "$6,850"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.52, 0.93, 1.17, 1.42, 1.55, 1.94, 2.28, 2.51, 2.78, 3.25]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Its balance was $75 higher, at $6,850.", "t0": 22.71, "t1": 26.64, "shot": "r5", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Its balance was $75 higher, at $6,850"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.5, 0.63, 1.17, 1.45, 2.0, 2.15, 2.35, 2.74, 2.92, 3.14, 3.4]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The reports leave the adjustment unexplained.", "t0": 26.76, "t1": 28.65, "shot": "r6", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "The reports leave the adjustment unexplained"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.46, 0.65, 0.74, 1.25]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "By October 2020 staff said the deadline to enforce collection had passed.", "t0": 28.87, "t1": 32.68, "shot": "r7", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "oct", "kicker": "October 2020", "text": "$6,850", "mark": "$6,850"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.6, 0.74, 1.04, 1.39, 1.65, 1.81, 1.91, 2.35, 2.46, 2.79, 3.2, 3.3]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The March 2021 update still listed $6,850.", "t0": 32.8, "t1": 36.82, "shot": "r8", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$6,850", "label": "March 2021 balance"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.39, 0.66, 1.15, 1.51, 1.75, 2.09, 2.28, 2.78, 3.01, 3.26, 3.53]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "A closing entry or a later payment remains unverified.", "t0": 36.94, "t1": 39.81, "shot": "r9", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "A closing entry or a later payment remains unverified"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.54, 0.96, 1.14, 1.21, 1.48, 1.83, 2.15]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 39.93, "t1": 42.08, "shot": "r10", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.31, 0.65, 0.8, 1.06, 1.17, 1.26, 1.5, 1.76]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"p": "The late fees", "b": "The payment", "o": "The collection deadline"}, "look": "newsroom", "hook": "document"}